{
  "title": "Edge Location · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "사용자 가까이에서 AWS의 콘텐츠 전송과 네트워크 기능을 제공합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Edge Location</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#guide-1\">원본과 캐시의 관계</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#guide-2\">엣지에서 수행하는 처리</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>기초</span><span>19 / 62</span></div><h1>Edge Location</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>엣지 로케이션은 <strong>사용자와 가까운 위치에서 콘텐츠 전송 등의 기능을 제공하는 AWS 접점</strong>입니다. CloudFront는 이런 위치를 활용해 요청을 처리하고 캐시된 콘텐츠를 전달합니다.</p><p>리전이 애플리케이션과 데이터의 주요 운영 위치라면, 엣지는 사용자가 서비스에 접근하는 거리를 줄이는 데 초점을 둡니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"point-of-presence\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"regional-edge-cache\"></span><h2>원본과 캐시의 관계</h2><p>사용자는 가까운 CloudFront 접점으로 요청합니다. 필요한 콘텐츠가 캐시에 있으면 그 자리에서 전달하고, 없으면 원본 쪽에서 가져옵니다.</p><p>CloudFront의 캐시 계층과 Origin Shield를 활용하면 원본에 도달하는 중복 요청을 줄일 수 있습니다. 캐시 만료와 사용자별 응답 구분은 별도 정책으로 정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"origin\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"origin-shield\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"edge-computing\"></span><h2>엣지에서 수행하는 처리</h2><p>일부 요청 처리 코드를 사용자 가까운 위치에서 실행할 수 있습니다. URL 변경이나 헤더 처리 같은 작업은 CloudFront Functions 또는 Lambda@Edge의 지원 범위에 맞춰 선택합니다.</p><p>엣지에서 처리하더라도 원본 애플리케이션과 데이터 저장소의 가용성은 따로 설계합니다. 캐시할 수 없는 요청은 원본까지 전달되는 경로의 영향을 받습니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>사용자와 원본 사이의 전달</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>사용자</strong><span>콘텐츠 요청</span></li><li><strong>엣지 접점</strong><span>캐시·지원되는 요청 처리</span></li><li><strong>원본 서비스</strong><span>필요한 데이터 제공</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">엣지는 원본을 대체하는 저장소가 아니라 사용자에게 전달할 경로의 일부입니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>한국과 유럽의 사용자가 같은 이미지를 조회합니다. 이미지는 한 리전의 S3에 보관하고 각 사용자 가까운 CloudFront 캐시에서 전달합니다.</p></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudFront/latest/DeveloperGuide/Introduction.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon CloudFront? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q003\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q003\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q003</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q003/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to reduce static image download latency for users worldwide and lower requests to its origin server. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Multi-AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Transit Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q003\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS snapshots</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">엣지</a>에 콘텐츠를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a>해 사용자 가까이 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/edge/\">Edge Location</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q082\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q082\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q082</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q082/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A design serves private S3 objects through CloudFront using a domain name. Which service-to-role mapping is correct?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 provides DNS, CloudFront delivers content, and S3 stores objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 performs HTTP path-based load balancing</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 caches S3 objects</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q082\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront grants IAM roles</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 응답과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CDN</a> 캐싱, 객체 저장은 각 서비스의 다른 역할이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">CloudFront</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q023\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q023\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q023</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q023/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants DNS responses for a domain to switch to another Region based on health checks. Which service is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q023\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 헬스 체크와 장애 조치 라우팅 정책을 쓴다. 클라이언트 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">캐시</a> 때문에 전환은 즉시 완료되지 않을 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q025\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q025\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q025</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q025/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs fixed IP addresses and optimized routing to healthy TCP endpoints in multiple Regions. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q025\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Transfer Acceleration alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q025\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q025\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront object caching alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q025\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Global Accelerator</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a>는 anycast 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 글로벌 네트워크를 활용해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>로 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q024\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q024\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q024</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Requests to /api and /images on the same domain must be routed to different backends based on their HTTP paths. Which load balancer type should be used?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Application Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q024\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>는 경로 기반 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 라우팅을 지원한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>만으로 HTTP <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol)</span> 경로를 해석하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">ELB / ALB / NLB</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">Route 53</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">이전 용어 <b>ECS / EKS / Fargate</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">다음 용어 <b>EFS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
